      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The survey showed that 95% of respondents wanted some form of AI labeling, but there was no consensus on filtering criteria. So why not bring these different needs together into an AI Disclosure & Scoring System?\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/introducing-the-ai-disclosure-scoring-system\n\nThis system adopts the seven AI usage categories identified in the survey on world creation, providing creators with a checklist and optional explanations to disclose their AI usage, replacing the single generic AI label.\n\nFor users, it provides a score-based filter that allows them to filter the world list according to their personal tolerance for AI-generated content.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
